sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor User as User Mobile Handset
    participant App as sdrive Client (Ente)
    participant VPN as Tailscale WireGuard Overlay
    participant Museum as Museum API (Go Daemon)
    participant DB as PostgreSQL 16
    participant Garage as Garage S3 Daemon (Rust)
    participant Disk as Flash Storage (/var/lib/garage)

    Note over User,App: Step 1: Client-Side Processing & Encryption
    User->>App: Capture New Photo / Video
    App->>App: Extract EXIF & GPS Coordinates
    App->>App: Render Compressed Thumbnail
    App->>App: Derive Key via Argon2id (Master Passphrase)
    App->>App: Encrypt Payload & Thumbnails (XChaCha20-Poly1305)

    Note over App,Museum: Step 2: Out-of-Band Intent Authorization
    App->>VPN: Send POST /api/v1/upload/intent (File Hash, Ciphertext Size)
    VPN->>Museum: Forward Encrypted TLS Request
    Museum->>DB: Query User Quota & Active Session
    DB-->>Museum: Session Valid & Quota Available
    Museum->>Garage: Generate Pre-Signed S3 PUT URL (HMAC-SHA256, 10m TTL)
    Garage-->>Museum: Pre-Signed URL Endpoint
    Museum-->>VPN: HTTP 200 (Pre-Signed URL Payload)
    VPN-->>App: Deliver Pre-Signed S3 URL

    Note over App,Garage: Step 3: Direct Data Plane Stream
    App->>VPN: HTTP PUT /sdrive-data/blob-uuid (Direct Ciphertext Stream)
    VPN->>Garage: Stream Multi-Megabyte Ciphertext (Bypassing Museum Heap)
    Garage->>Disk: Asynchronous Write & fsync (Tokio I/O)
    Disk-->>Garage: Block Acknowledged
    Garage-->>VPN: HTTP 200 OK (ETag Verified)
    VPN-->>App: Upload Acknowledged

    Note over App,DB: Step 4: Metadata Commitment
    App->>VPN: POST /api/v1/upload/confirm (Encrypted Metadata, Album ID)
    VPN->>Museum: Forward Final Commit Payload
    Museum->>DB: INSERT INTO file_metadata (file_id, encrypted_meta, committed=TRUE)
    DB-->>Museum: Transaction Committed
    Museum-->>VPN: HTTP 201 Created (Upload Index Complete)
    VPN-->>App: Sync Complete Banner
